{"call_id": "52267ae1b3644d538001a8ffaf906412", "success": true, "result_file": "/data/nly/Agent-Aware-Trajectory-Level-Query/benchmark/fullbench/runs/natural/yelp/query2/full-01/results/52267ae1b3644d538001a8ffaf906412.json", "row_count": null, "preview": "{\"submitted\": true, \"answer\": \"ANSWER: Missouri (MO) has the highest number of reviews, and the average rating of businesses in that state is approximately 3.91.\\n\\nMETHOD:\\n1. Extracted each business's U.S. state from the `description` field of the MongoDB `business` collection (e.g., \\\"in St. Louis, MO,\\\") using a state-abbreviation pattern. All 100 businesses parsed successfully.\\n2. Summed the `review_count` metadata per state. Missouri (MO) ranked first with 2,243 total reviews across 9 businesses, ahead of Pennsylvania (PA, 2,022) and Florida (FL, 565).\\n3. Joined the 9 Missouri businesses (businessid_4, 10, 11, 24, 30, 46, 47, 64, 96) to the DuckDB `review` table via the numeric identifier suffix (businessid_N -> businessref_N) and averaged the ratings of all their reviews (213 reviews in the review table).\\n\\nRESULT:\\n- State with the most reviews: Missouri (MO), 2,243 total reviews (business metadata review_count).\\n- Average rating of Missouri businesses: 3.9061 (review-weighted average of ratings across all 213 reviews; simple mean of per-business average ratings is 4.00).\\n\"}", "truncated": false}
